  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-6444 GEF: Integrated Community-based Management of High Value Mountain Ecosystems in Southern Kyrgyzstan for Multiple Benefits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">: The objective of the project is to secure high value mountain ecosystem biodiversity and associated ecosystem services, while ensuring resilient and sustainable livelihoods in Kyrgyzstan&#x2019;s Pamir-Alai landscape. The project&#x2019;s components have been designed to address key threats and corresponding barriers to sustainable land management and biodiversity conservation within mountain forest and pasture ecosystems including Key Biodiversity Areas (KBAs) found in Kyrgyzstan&#x2019;s Pamir-Alai Mountain land</narrative>
  </description>
